  "title": "Nutty Quick Middle Eastern Cashew Tagine",
  "description": "A quick and flavorful Middle Eastern dish featuring cashew nuts, perfect for a weeknight dinner, this herbal and snappy tagine is a great option for those looking for a jain-friendly meal.",
