  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, coriander, turmeric, and smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cashew nuts and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Season the tagine with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the Nutty Quick Middle Eastern Cashew Tagine hot over rice or with naan bread."
